{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's New Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Sales Pitch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Taking Part in a Meeting"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you are taking part in a meeting, it is important to respond to the ideas that are being discussed. Sometimes you will agree and sometimes you will not. Here are some ways you can agree politely in English:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"bold\\\"> Agreeing</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I agree.</li> <li>Right! </li> <li>Absolutely.</li> <li>I'm sure you'd agree that ...</li> <li>Definitely.</li> <li>I think that's a fantastic idea.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also agree with someone but not entirely, especially when there is a doubt or you are not sure of agreeing with something completely. <br/>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Partial agreement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I agree up to a point. However, ...</li><li>That's true, but ...</li><li>I agree with you in part, but ...</li><li>I agree with you in part, but ... </li><li>This is only partly true. </il></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for and Giving Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are taking part in a meeting, it is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own. Here are some ways you can ask for and give opinions. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for opinions \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Giving Opinions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Always ask questions that encourage a response</span>:  <ul><li>What do you think about/of ... ?</li> <li>What's your position on ... ?</li> <li>How do you feel (about ... )? </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">When you give opinions, make your opinions less forceful by using neutral statements</span>: <ul><li>The way I see it ... </li> <li>Personally, I think ...  </li> <li>If you ask me, ... </li> <li>I'd say ... </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">What do you think about</span> our sales pitch?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">What's your position on</span> creating a website?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">The way I see it</span>, the sales pitch really needs to impress them. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Personally, I think</span> the best sales pitch is don't try to sell."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sales pitch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a presentation you make to persuade people to buy something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to be very specific in our sales pitch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when discussing a sales pitch."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "self-assurance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "calm and confident about what you are doing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I think we should start by showing self-assurance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rapport"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "friendly understanding between people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to build good rapport with our client."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "follower "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " someone who is tracking a particular person, group or organization on a social media website or application"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  This is going to help the company attract more followers online."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "engagement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when you become involved with someone or something in order to understand them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's important to post company updates to promote engagement with the public."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "selling point "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a particular quality that something has which will make people want to buy it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  We need to focus on our selling point and what makes us unique."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to liaise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to exchange information in order to be more effective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We will be liaising with social media in order to create publicity for the company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the situation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose the role you want."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice talking about the situation in the role play. Continue speaking for as long as you can."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Then, switch roles with your partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Situation:</span><br/><br/>  Role 1: You are in a meeting at work. You are asked to share your opinion about a new software. Give your opinion.<br/><br/>  Role 2: You are managing a meeting at work. You ask for an employee's opinion about a new software. Listen to their opinion. Agree with the their. Then, give your opinion. <br/><br/>  Change  roles.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask for an opinion in a meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my opinion in a meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I agree politely in a meeting."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask for and give opinions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can agree politely. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Have you been in a situation where you had to share your opinion with other people? What was the opinion you shared?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Did other people agree or disagree with you? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " What do you think we should do? "}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nJanet and Miranda have a meeting in her office. What are they talking about? \n"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the aud